        {
            "id": "83eeccae-185a-4ab1-a4f1-6b9c0f2465bb",
            "build_id": "6fb48444-91fe-4d00-bd52-fab583fa813b",
            "round_number": 5,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-04T20:29:14.926977+00:00",
            "notes": "[Pocket Projector](item_5c95fa4f-6f53-494e-9b4a-a7e2766cb1e8) is a pretty bad power, but it helps slightly with survival so we take it. It also happens to proc a 2nd instance of  [Tesla Field](item_68f73d99-6d07-40f5-ad28-0c69f45487c7)  and  [Unstable Prototype](item_3c4fac62-90b1-49f8-8602-ba89abcbf437) which can be pretty strong.\n\nIf the enemy tank is being a nightmare for your team or you guys are just struggling to get kills in general, take  [Three-tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429) instead of  [Unstable Prototype](item_3c4fac62-90b1-49f8-8602-ba89abcbf437) and try to help them burn down the tank.\n\nYou can also substitute [Unstable Prototype](item_3c4fac62-90b1-49f8-8602-ba89abcbf437) for [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) if enemy healing is an issue.",
