        {
            "id": "5b807144-8f14-4fe3-8f0e-3d65a6073f1d",
            "build_id": "6fb48444-91fe-4d00-bd52-fab583fa813b",
            "round_number": 6,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-04T20:29:14.926977+00:00",
            "notes": "Adding  [Three-tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429) since it's your main source of damage. Remember do not waste cooldowns without dealing weapon damage in between...ie: if you leap in, don't drop bubble in mid air or something. Leap, zap, bubble, zap, leap, zap. That little combo right there deals 27% of the target's health from  [Three-tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429) alone in under 2 seconds.\n\nI like  [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) at this point because Primal is basically useless now. Your entire gameplay loop is chaining leap, bubble, 3TT and being so absurdly evasive with a 2.5sec leap and a 6sec bubble that you just don't ever die.\n\nYou can also substitute [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) for [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) if enemy healing is an issue.",
